  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Meanwhile, grate zucchini. Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Pour boiling water into a large saucepan over high heat. Add a pinch of salt, then bring to the boil. Cook fettuccine in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 9 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people), then drain pasta and return to saucepan. Drizzle with olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507a81aa0d3479ba2c301ba-b17a56d1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook snacking tomatoes, until slightly blistered, 3 minutes.\n• Add zucchini, and cook, stirring, until tender 2-3 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507a81aa0d3479ba2c301ba-82165ac5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic paste, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in light cooking cream and vegetable stock pot and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in basil pesto, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), fettuccine and reserved pasta water until heated through. Remove pan from heat then stir in zucchini and blistered tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507a81aa0d3479ba2c301ba-4dbcfb20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine apple, mixed salad leaves, flaked almonds and a drizzle of olive oil and the vinegar. Season.\n• Divide creamy pesto and cherry tomato pasta between bowls. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Serve with apple and almond salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6507a81aa0d3479ba2c301ba-9658b4b6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
